-          "quote": "Let $F$ be a field, $q\\ge1$, and $M\\in F^{q\\times q}$. Let $\\operatorname{adj}(M)$ be the adjugate defined by the cofactors of [[def-matrix-minors-cofactors-and-adjugate]]. Then\n\n$$\nM\\operatorname{adj}(M)=\\det(M)I_q.\n$$\n\nConsequently, when $\\det(M)\\ne0$, $M^{-1}=\\operatorname{adj}(M)/\\det(M)$; when $\\det(M)=0$, $M$ is singular.",
